sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as OCC / PCU
  participant W as web
  participant A as api: agent runner
  participant C as Claude API (tool use)
  participant E as engine tools (read-only)
  participant P as PostgreSQL
  U->>W: Ask the agent (flight, optional delay, strategy, note)
  W->>A: POST /agent/runs
  A->>P: agent_runs row (RUNNING)
  loop up to 12 tool calls, 120 s
    A->>C: messages + tool definitions
    C-->>A: progress note + tool_use
    A->>E: status · rotation · assess_delay · compare · impact
    E-->>A: counts and flight facts only, incl. crew FDP check
    A->>P: append step to the trace
  end
  C-->>A: submit_recommendation(option, reasons, risks, checks)
  A->>A: option must exist in the engine result
  A->>P: run DONE (or planner fallback)
  W->>A: poll run
  U->>W: open scenario → approve / override (audited)
